Analyst --> UC_TargetRun
Analyst --> UC_StepRun
Analyst --> UC_Stop
Analyst --> UC_IOC
Analyst --> UC_CVE
Analyst --> UC_Enriched
Analyst --> UC_Mitre
Analyst --> UC_Corr
Analyst --> UC_TGChannels
Analyst --> UC_Leaks
Analyst --> UC_LeakDetail
Analyst --> UC_CSV
Analyst --> UC_Bulletin
Analyst --> UC_STIX
Analyst --> UC_MISP
Analyst --> UC_Report
Analyst --> UC_CreateSched
